  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/551736/description_41eb5295-28bb-4928-b100-985e1ea96066.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Неофициальный порт для нескольких загрузчиков <em>LambDynamicLights</em>, совместимый с Sodium и Embeddium. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Рекомендуется использовать в связке с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Toni's Immersive Lanterns</a>!</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103431/description_81b22102-8cb4-4adc-843f-5a033bb00637.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/SodiumDynamicLights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103431/description_7d2b55fa-b9e2-4316-9e65-5b76a7178843.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/551736/description_af1208ed-ad32-4f21-82c8-dd0d98b26597.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WaaBDVH.png\"></span></p>\n<p>Посмотреть работу мода можно в видео от автора оригинальной версии, LambdAurora:</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r8r1TNG45tM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Пожалуйста, не создавайте репорты на GitHub для оригинального разработчика Fabric-версии.</em></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kyBCuYUzFB\" rel=\"nofollow\">Наш Discord</a></p>",
